    <item>
      <title>Oedipus: LLM-enchanced Reasoning CAPTCHA Solver</title>
      <link>https://geleideng.github.io/publication/oedipus/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 01 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://geleideng.github.io/publication/oedipus/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Oedipus demonstrates the vulnerability of reasoning-based CAPTCHAs to LLM-powered attacks, highlighting the need for more robust human verification mechanisms in the age of advanced AI.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>IllusionCAPTCHA: A CAPTCHA based on Visual Illusion</title>
      <link>https://geleideng.github.io/publication/illusioncaptcha/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 28 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://geleideng.github.io/publication/illusioncaptcha/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;IllusionCAPTCHA responds to the weakening of traditional CAPTCHA schemes in the LLM era by designing verification challenges around perceptual illusions rather than text recognition or simple reasoning.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
